    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38974" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβρέμω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to roar</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ᾽</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>)
